                <l xml:id="m-85cd4201-ea69-4e3a-9546-dbaeefb4056e" facs="#m-3bb06361-2964-4a1a-ac89-f8532a397876" label="text-like">The Common Commemorations of Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-0659941c-797d-4adf-a976-4b4b89168a6c" facs="#m-5b7af842-f84a-4bf5-ba50-d71aa22fff09" label="ambiguous">2627</l><l xml:id="m-f28e620d-ed36-49a8-a64e-8d9f1645ba12" facs="#m-9a299ded-ce1c-405b-b7aa-82c290ce4415" label="text-like">At H. Vespers:</l><l xml:id="m-6c3f512a-e253-4afd-b113-14d9826d8a60" facs="#m-f4cf4ff4-565d-4b40-ae59-2f5977236edb" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústum dedúxit Dóminus per vias réctas. (P. T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-d8081770-c274-4c60-81bf-2b973987f286" facs="#m-48ca7825-40ae-4b3c-8e29-e47bb40d1afc" label="lyrics-like">E. Et osténdit illi régnum Déi. (P. T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-8fba47b8-abda-42d6-acf6-47f4a6fa33ef" facs="#m-23e08573-b07b-4882-b48e-031b1f8ca1c3" label="text-like">If a Commemoration of another Doctor is to be made at ist or and</l><l xml:id="m-4c83f984-b3f0-4675-83b7-c92a2ff51034" facs="#m-4b671c14-e48f-48f8-a4e9-c9df9a1e82d4" label="text-like">Vespers the Antiphon and Prayer are taken from the Common of a Confessor</l><l xml:id="m-d23c668a-d2e4-46ac-bd4e-225898b88c74" facs="#m-493d33df-57c4-4efa-b675-4d8473615235" label="text-like">Bishop or a Confessor not a Bishop, as the case may be.</l><l xml:id="m-c744667b-29f0-4ff7-8ca0-642e8d23b05f" facs="#m-6c1e05c1-27ed-458f-8205-54688af82828" label="text-like">FOR A CONFESSOR NOT A BISHOP.</l><l xml:id="m-d3dc0e2d-bf3e-4ed3-8126-481565ead545" facs="#m-cd28250b-a203-49b0-aede-841f6b23c5b6" label="text-like">At I. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-44fc0b6f-ef5d-40b2-883a-1811e8310344" facs="#m-b78ee071-ba0f-42c1-a00d-ae47a7282b1c" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-f21f854a-f66a-4e8b-b634-786be3086cef" facs="#m-f049a581-0a65-4dc2-bba3-e8f74f4c7283" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-358f6d1d-7244-4ac2-8235-905ee3f2da06" facs="#m-e06d582b-4bfb-46da-8903-7220d8ca723c" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-dddea168-0e50-46eb-a845-d0859d3ee295" facs="#m-99e7849c-5334-4eca-bf95-1bd310efe395" label="lyrics-like">Imi-lábo é¬um</l><l xml:id="m-b06ec17e-fd59-4434-a95e-ea4a8edd794b" facs="#m-f7caea6e-82ed-4ce1-9f8b-007057bf6707" label="lyrics-like">ví-ro sa-pi-énti, qui aedi-fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-47f85dfe-7da2-42ce-a607-58a4192cdca6" facs="#m-85b19986-aeb3-4135-a040-9d302428c131" label="lyrics-like">cá-vit dómum sú-am supra pétram. P. T. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-5accd18c-e9bc-40e4-9781-fa2bb66022d7" facs="#m-d68496c5-3153-4e82-bd16-0ffdce50a613" label="lyrics-like">V. Amávit éum Dóminus, et ornávit éum. (P. T. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-e3b21942-476b-4d9d-adf5-a4d705d8a474" facs="#m-32e8b126-9951-4fec-9c43-3805669a0c93" label="lyrics-like">R. Stólam glóriae induit éum. (P. T. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-69e1f709-361b-484a-b288-38a092a4944e" facs="#m-3c3af7aa-9ee3-4427-84d5-accd6db49575" label="text-like">At II. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-69d2a6ce-6104-4f61-86e6-dcab62d154fc" facs="#m-c09e2ef0-164c-49b0-be86-39aebbabc70e" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-1c6f1765-94d0-4c3f-8c51-76dd1d8f4a27" facs="#m-4274a1a5-3852-4b01-a9e8-cc133577b463" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-f8415c10-6958-4494-bf0c-c1edc89832b6" facs="#m-753e56b5-ff7b-464d-93d9-5799af09c972" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-43afe844-fb60-4b59-aa1d-db3966b1324f" facs="#m-71cf7fb5-2dbf-41a4-a8af-385e0ade242d" label="lyrics-like">IC vir, despí-ci-ens múndum* et terréna, tri-úm¬</l><l xml:id="m-85079145-fb9e-4d5b-99a9-594f035986bd" facs="#m-1e19d90e-9f5f-49db-9cdd-9a0267f2b361" label="lyrics-like">cóndi-dit ó-re, má-nu.</l><l xml:id="m-e9ed98ec-9da9-46ab-9e94-acc0c28dd919" facs="#m-7650e014-4ecb-4752-af2e-7469edddf34b" label="lyrics-like">phans, di-ví-ti-as caé- lo</l><l xml:id="m-9ee3ccd8-6950-4390-b14c-114c8ad7d0dd" facs="#m-6ff451f1-5f68-453c-8683-b67c2b54a0b7" label="lyrics-like">Pr. Alle-lú-ia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>